<title>JAPAN: Asahi Tec -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Tec -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.95		vs	   26.43</p>
<p> Operating	  763    million	  vs	  639    million</p>
<p> Current	    827    million	  vs	  930    million</p>
<p> Net		  302    million	  vs	  583    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.05 yen	  vs	    9.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     60 million	  vs	  60 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Tec Corp makes malleable iron products and is affiliated with NGK Insulators Ltd.</p>
</text>
